"accessibility.guide" = "1. Click “Open System Settings”.\n2. If HotPlainText is already in the list, select it and remove it with “−”.\n   (An old permission may not work after the app is rebuilt.)\n3. Click “+” and add HotPlainText from the Applications folder.\n   (You can also drag it from the Finder window that opens.)\n4. Turn on the HotPlainText you added.\n5. When the permission is on, HotPlainText reopens by itself.\n\nYou’re done when the menu shows “Accessibility: Allowed”.";
